{"id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-category.md","title":"Category","display":"df-category — Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-category","aliases":["93-df-category"],"display":"df-category — Category","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-category — Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> is a set of objects and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H:O^2\\to V\">\\(H:O^2\\to V\\)</span> is a family of pairwise disjoint hom-sets.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:O\\to V\">\\(e:O\\to V\\)</span> chooses identities, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:O^3\\to V\">\\(m:O^3\\to V\\)</span> stores all typed composition maps.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,-)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,-)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IdFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{IdFam}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CompFam}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> are explicit projections from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}\\)</span> is the small-category predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq O,&amp;\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle}(A,B)&amp;\\coloneqq H(\\langle A,B\\rangle),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IdFam}_{93}(\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq e,&amp;\n\\operatorname{CompFam}_{93}(\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq m,\\\\\n\\mathrm{id}^{\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle}_A&amp;\\coloneqq e(A),&amp;\ng\\circ_{\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle}f&amp;\\coloneqq\nm(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle)(\\langle g,f\\rangle)\n\\quad\\bigl(f\\in H(\\langle A,B\\rangle),\\ g\\in H(\\langle B,C\\rangle)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq O,&amp;\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle}(A,B)&amp;\\coloneqq H(\\langle A,B\\rangle),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IdFam}_{93}(\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq e,&amp;\n\\operatorname{CompFam}_{93}(\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq m,\\\\\n\\mathrm{id}^{\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle}_A&amp;\\coloneqq e(A),&amp;\ng\\circ_{\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle}f&amp;\\coloneqq\nm(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle)(\\langle g,f\\rangle)\n\\quad\\bigl(f\\in H(\\langle A,B\\rangle),\\ g\\in H(\\langle B,C\\rangle)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\exists O,H,e,m\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle\\land O\\in V\\land H:O^2\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,A&#39;,B&#39;\\in O\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle A,B\\rangle\\neq\\langle A&#39;,B&#39;\\rangle\\to\nH(\\langle A,B\\rangle)\\cap H(\\langle A&#39;,B&#39;\\rangle)=\\varnothing\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land e:O\\to V\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\bigl(e(A)\\in H(\\langle A,A\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land m:O^3\\to V\\land\\forall A,B,C\\in O\\;\\Bigl(\nm(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle):\nH(\\langle B,C\\rangle)\\times H(\\langle A,B\\rangle)\n\\to H(\\langle A,C\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,C,D\\in O\\;\\forall f\\in H(\\langle A,B\\rangle)\\;\n\\forall g\\in H(\\langle B,C\\rangle)\\;\\forall h\\in H(\\langle C,D\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl((h\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=h\\circ_{\\mathcal C}(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in O\\;\\forall f\\in H(\\langle A,B\\rangle)\\;\n\\bigl(f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A=f\n\\land\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=f\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\exists O,H,e,m\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle\\land O\\in V\\land H:O^2\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,A&#39;,B&#39;\\in O\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle A,B\\rangle\\neq\\langle A&#39;,B&#39;\\rangle\\to\nH(\\langle A,B\\rangle)\\cap H(\\langle A&#39;,B&#39;\\rangle)=\\varnothing\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land e:O\\to V\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\bigl(e(A)\\in H(\\langle A,A\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land m:O^3\\to V\\land\\forall A,B,C\\in O\\;\\Bigl(\nm(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle):\nH(\\langle B,C\\rangle)\\times H(\\langle A,B\\rangle)\n\\to H(\\langle A,C\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,C,D\\in O\\;\\forall f\\in H(\\langle A,B\\rangle)\\;\n\\forall g\\in H(\\langle B,C\\rangle)\\;\\forall h\\in H(\\langle C,D\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl((h\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=h\\circ_{\\mathcal C}(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in O\\;\\forall f\\in H(\\langle A,B\\rangle)\\;\n\\bigl(f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A=f\n\\land\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=f\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The atom explicitly defines small categories. Hom-sets, identities, and composition maps are stored as function graphs on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O^2\">\\(O^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O^3\">\\(O^3\\)</span>; no indexed composition family remains at the metalevel.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"H:O^2\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"e:O\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"m:O^3\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,-)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IdFam}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CompFam}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle}&\\coloneqq O,&\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle}(A,B)&\\coloneqq H(\\langle A,B\\rangle),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IdFam}_{93}(\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle)&\\coloneqq e,&\n\\operatorname{CompFam}_{93}(\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle)&\\coloneqq m,\\\\\n\\mathrm{id}^{\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle}_A&\\coloneqq e(A),&\ng\\circ_{\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle}f&\\coloneqq\nm(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle)(\\langle g,f\\rangle)\n\\quad\\bigl(f\\in H(\\langle A,B\\rangle),\\ g\\in H(\\langle B,C\\rangle)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\exists O,H,e,m\\;\\Bigl[{}&\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,H,e,m\\rangle\\land O\\in V\\land H:O^2\\to V\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B,A',B'\\in O\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle A,B\\rangle\\neq\\langle A',B'\\rangle\\to\nH(\\langle A,B\\rangle)\\cap H(\\langle A',B'\\rangle)=\\varnothing\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land e:O\\to V\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\bigl(e(A)\\in H(\\langle A,A\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land m:O^3\\to V\\land\\forall A,B,C\\in O\\;\\Bigl(\nm(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle):\nH(\\langle B,C\\rangle)\\times H(\\langle A,B\\rangle)\n\\to H(\\langle A,C\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B,C,D\\in O\\;\\forall f\\in H(\\langle A,B\\rangle)\\;\n\\forall g\\in H(\\langle B,C\\rangle)\\;\\forall h\\in H(\\langle C,D\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\quad\\bigl((h\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=h\\circ_{\\mathcal C}(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B\\in O\\;\\forall f\\in H(\\langle A,B\\rangle)\\;\n\\bigl(f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A=f\n\\land\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=f\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"O^2","display":false},{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"O^3","display":false}],"bytes":2541,"backlinks":[{"id":"a57fde3586b9e79c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"610e35470f5c7f53","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fbf91595366c330b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)$, with $\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}$ and $\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}$ as in [[93-df-category]]."},{"id":"8311ab8098e68fa0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}$ and $\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}$ (the object and hom-set projections of [[93-df-category]])"},{"id":"58d8bff43d6d4102","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b3500ab2f8429ba4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal{C}}$ (hom-class, see [[93-df-category]])"},{"id":"7702f850d0f755f5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)$, with object and hom sets $\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}$ and $\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}$ as in [[93-df-category]]."},{"id":"5b57b2e83882e1d8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)$ (see [[93-df-category]])"},{"id":"7f1ed77100bfbf2a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_{B}$ is the identity projection of [[93-df-category]]."},{"id":"bf7570e62e6f3e21","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal D$ and $\\mathcal C$ are category candidates with projections $\\mathrm{Obj}_{(-)}$, $\\mathrm{Hom}_{(-)}$, $\\mathrm{id}^{(-)}$, and $\\circ_{(-)}$ from [[93-df-category]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-category]]"}],"outgoing":["e30eac382dc7d1a7"]}